|----------------|----------------|------------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------|
| NaAlH₄ | Reduces | No (no needed) | No (no needed) |
| LiAlH₄ | Reacts (fast) | Reacts (faster at room temperature) | Reacts (fast) |

