\]

Now, we can use mass balance to find the concentration of the compound in the original drinking water sample. The mass balance equation is:

\[
C_{\text{standard}} \times V_{\text{standard}} + C_{\text{sample}} \times V_{\text{standard}} = C_{\text{final}} \times V_{\text{final}}
\]

