\[
0.000100 \, \text{mol} + 0.100 \, \text{L} \times C_{\text{sample}} = 0.001355 \, \text{mol}
\]

\[
0.100 \, \text{L} \times C_{\text{standard}} = 0.001355 \, \text{mol} - 0.000100 \, \text{mol}
