   Substituting \( V_2 = nV_1 \):  
   \[
   W = -P(nV_1 - V_1) = -PV_1 (n - 1)
   \]  

4. **Final Answer**:  
   The work done on the gas is \(\boxed{P V_1 (n - 1)}\).  

